# Marketing voice

Copyright (c) 2026 Devrecated.

Extra layer on [professional-voice](professional-voice.mdc) for public sites only (`docs/**` is out of scope). Finished sentences. No chat asides. No invented APIs, prices, or 10× claims beyond observed lift already on the page. Professional, not slogan salad.

Address the buyer as **you**. Do not use “they/their” for the customer unless a named third party is in the sentence.

Write what a buyer needs to decide and do. Do not narrate internals: script tags as a security story, tokens, origins, popups, Firestore, MCP, request-type machinery, sign-in origin, “the page does not receive tokens,” or hosted-side vs editor rebuild recipes.

When a next step helps, show it. Do not explain the model around it. Widget point: same day, in the product you already run.

```md
